plumb's playbook structure is derived from pstack
(https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan,
licensed under the MIT License.

principles/ holds 22 files. Of those, 21 are reproduced verbatim from pstack;
only their frontmatter was translated, and rewriting them in plumb's own words
is planned but not yet done. The remaining files are written from scratch for
plumb, not derived from pstack, and carry `origin: plumb` in their frontmatter.

scripts/check-harness.sh verifies these counts against the files themselves, so
the sentence above cannot drift when a principle is added.

See docs/scope.md for what was carried over, what was folded, and what was
deliberately left behind.
